        "id": 1107893
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-09T04:54:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I like the signature `int add_flags, int remove_flags` better than `int flagBitmask, int changeBitfields`. This is imo much easier to use.\n\nIf we do that we need to decide which one takes precedence if a particular flag is set on both sides to be removed and added. In that case I would lean towards keeping the flag up.",
